```rust
let parse = |s: &str| -> Vec<u64> {
    // Strip SemVer pre-release (-beta.1) / build (+5) metadata so tags like
    // "0.1.18-beta.1" compare by their numeric core.
    let core = s.split(['-', '+']).next().unwrap_or(s);
    core.split('.')
        .map(|part| part.parse::<u64>().unwrap_or(0))
        .collect()
};
```

This makes "0.1.18-beta.1" → [0,1,18], equal to "0.1.18" → not newer. Correct.

