Fix: `src/update.rs — version_is_newer` now strips SemVer pre-release (`-beta.1) and build (+5`) suffixes before comparing, so version tags like `0.1.18-beta.1` or `0.1.18+5` correctly compare against `0.1.17` instead of parsing the suffixed segment as `0` and hiding a newer release.

